WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.704
The greatest innovations in human history, 
from the wheel to the iPhone... 

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:07.841
...all had one thing in common: great user design!

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:11.311
As innovations migrate from the physical world to the digital,

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:16.282
the interactions between users and products need to be 
designed to ensure a great user experience.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:20.286
In Udacity’s brand new User Experience Designer Nanodegree program,

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:25.191
you’ll learn UX fundamentals and how to conduct 
design research and, when you finish,

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:32.866
you’ll be adept at journeying from concept to lo-fidelity prototypes, 
and from prototypes to high-fidelity UX Designs!

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:38.338
For the capstone project, you’ll build a case study 
that can be incorporated into a UX Portfolio!

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:41.574
The projects will give you real-world UX Designer experience! 

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:45.745
AND you’ll be able to use it to showcase 
your skills to prospective employers.

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:53.319
Udacity’s UX Designer Nanodegree program teaches you 
everything from visual design basics and UX design fundamentals

00:00:53.319 --> 00:01:01.294
to how to convert low-fi sketches into high-fi interactive design 
using Figma that are ready for engineering handoff!

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:06.533
UX Design is everywhere, from the smartphone in your pocket, 
to the interactive menus on your television!

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:09.569
Shape how humans interact with our world’s greatest products! 

